&lt;h2&gt;


🌍 3D Weather App
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Hey everyone,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I’ve been working on a weather app inspired by MSN Weather and Apple Weather and finally built a working version.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;


🔥 Features
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌬️ Animated wind flow across the map&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌡️ Temperature visualization (hot &amp;amp; cold regions)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🗺️ Interactive map (click anywhere to get weather)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;⚡ Real-time weather data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🎨 Modern UI with glassmorphism&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

